The '''Pack Magma Cube''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Pack Magma Cubes''' spawn naturally in the caves north and south of the {{Zone|Magma Chamber}}.

== Behavior ==
Upon being hit for the first time, Pack Magma Cubes will sometimes become 2 Pack Magma Cubes. They will attempt to jump towards the player and attack them, dealing {{Stat|dmg|4000}} on hit.

